{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dad6f20c-4a78-8e76-89bb-7b5e1baa224b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T10:14:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:08:05-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. Hi, my name is Barbara Hazard. I'm calling about a sidewalk, um, well, it's my mother's sidewalk, in front of her house. Or, no, it's the city sidewalk, in front of her house. Hmm. I guess I want to report it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's heaved up. One of the slabs, the roots or the frost or whatever it is, it's pushed up and there's an edge now. And I tripped on it yesterday. Well, I caught my toe on it. I didn't fall all the way down, but it was close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm glad you didn't go down. Are you hurt at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I'm fine. Just my toe, a little sore. I'm not calling about that, I just want it fixed before somebody else trips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Where is this? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:09:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 455 Van Zandt Avenue. In the North End. Let me see, it's on the, hmm, the side of the house, the sidewalk runs along the front, and the bad slab is right about in front of the walkway up to the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "455 Van Zandt. Got it. And how big a problem are we talking about? How much is it raised, or how big is the section?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, let me think. The slab itself is about two feet across, the part that's pushed up. Maybe a little more, no, I'd say two feet. And the lip is, I don't know, a couple inches maybe. Enough to catch a shoe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that'll do it. Is the sidewalk cracked through, or is it one piece that's tilted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's tilted, mostly. There's a crack along one side too. Um, one side's up and the other side's flat. So it's like a little ramp, sort of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm writing that down. So what I can do is put it in as a sidewalk repair request, and it goes to the crew supervisor, who looks at them in order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Yes. Can you add the street to the repair list? I mean, add that spot, on Van Zandt, to the list. I don't know how you say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly right, I'll add that location to the sidewalk repair list. Someone will go out and look at it first, to see what it needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:11:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is that, hmm, do they, would they call my mother? Or me? I'd rather they call me, she doesn't always get to the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put you down as the contact. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:11:40-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0164. Oh, hang on. Hmm. My phone's, no, wait, this is the landline, I'm okay. But my cell, I've got it at three percent and the charger's across the room. I was going to take a photo of the slab for you. Do you want a picture?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:12:04-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A photo would be helpful, but you don't need to send it today. If you want to, you can send one later with the address on it. For now I have enough to log this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:12:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so, I'll just plug it in then. Let me not worry about it right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Let me read back what I've got. 455 Van Zandt Avenue, North End, a heaved sidewalk slab about two feet across, a lip of a couple of inches, and you tripped on it yesterday. Contact is Barbara Hazard at 401-555-0164. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:12:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Well, except it's not me who lives there, it's my mother. But yes, call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I'll note that you're calling on her behalf. Anything else on the street, like other bad spots near the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Let me think. There's the one a few houses down, I think, but I'm not sure of the number, so I'll leave that. Actually, no. Just this one for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. If you find the other one, call back with the address and we'll add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And roughly when would somebody come look? Or is that something you don't know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Inspections usually happen within a couple of weeks, though winter can stretch that. The repair itself comes after, and that depends on the work schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's, yeah, that's fine. I just wanted it on the list. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Barbara. Take care of that toe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T10:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
